<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion estimate up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion estimate up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said on Tuesday it increased its estimate on United Dominion Realty Trust Inc's 1997 Funds From Operations to $1.42 from $1.37, reflecting projected accretion attributable to the company's planned merger with South West Property Trust Inc.</p>
<p>--&quot;We are initiating a six-month price target for United Dominion of $15.50, representing 11 times our 1997 FFO estimate,&quot; EVEREN said in a report.</p>
<p>--EVEREN's FFO estimates for the company are $1.25 in 1996 and $1.51 in 1998.</p>
<p>--United Dominion was unchanged at 14-3/4.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
